    "Keeps the list's books downloaded on this Mac; each Mac chooses for itself. Clearing it removes no download." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the Reading List's Keep these books on this Mac checkbox: a choice of this Mac's alone.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
