    "Library" : {
      "comment" : "Heading of the group of Library window keyboard shortcuts in Settings, and the title of the Library menu.\nTitle of the Library menu in the menu bar, which holds the commands for the library's books and folders. Only a Library window shows it.\nTitle of the first screen, the list of the user's books and folders."
    },
    "Library windows" : {
      "comment" : "Choice of the Works in pop-up of a keyboard shortcut: the shortcut works in the Library windows, where the library's books are listed.\nNames where a keyboard shortcut works, inside a sentence such as \"Works in Library windows.\": the Library windows, where the library's books are listed."
