    "Save" : {
      "comment" : "Button that keeps what was typed or changed in a sheet and closes it, such as a bookmark's note, a book's information, or a library view's name.\nButton that saves the changes made in a sheet.\nName of a keyboard shortcut action, listed in Settings in the audio editor group and read by VoiceOver. Saves the edited audio.",
