      "comment" : "A choice of the Reading List's When a book ends pop-up button: when a book opened from the list ends, stop there.\nName of a key of the keyboard, spoken by VoiceOver and shown in braille in a keyboard shortcut such as \"Command + Stop\".\nName of a keyboard shortcut action, listed in Settings in the Record window group and read by VoiceOver. Stops the recording.\nName of a keyboard shortcut action, listed in Settings in the audio editor group and read by VoiceOver. Stops playback in the audio editor.",
